        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Baldwin 85390, Modern Minneapolis Handleset</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Minneapolis Sectional Handleset was made to grace the big city; but even if you don't live in the urban jungle, this modern handleset is perfect to bring the glamour of Minneapolis to any home. It is available as a single cylinder handleset which means that it has a keyed lock on the outside and a thumb turn on the inside.  It features an easy installation, it has an adjustable backset for 2-3/4 inches or 2-3/8 inches for a door thickness of 1-3/4 inches.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis Baldwin Tubular Entrance Trim Set is designed for easy installation for standard pre-drilled wood or metal doors. It is fully reversible to accommodate all door conditions. Forged out of solid brass, it is built to last and is backed by a limited lifetime warranty to assure that it meets the Baldwin standards of excellence.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Baldwin 85390 Minneapolis Entrance Set:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Entrance handle, cylinder collar, lever, rose and turn piece are manufactured from solid forged brass for maximum strength and durability. </li>\r\n<li>Estate locksets are designed for easy installation in standard pre-bored wood or metal doors.</li>\r\n<li>Locksets accommodate a door thickness of 1-3/4”. Conversion kit available for 2” and 2-1/4” thick doors at an additional charge.</li>\r\n<li>Deadbolt and latch case are formed of steel for strength. Most interior working parts are made of solid brass or steel for maximum strength and smooth operation.</li>\r\n<li>Adjustable backset 2-3/8” or 2-3/4” latch and deadbolt supplied standard.</li>\r\n<li>Deadbolt and latch supplied with a 1” face plate</li>\r\n<li>Deadbolt is furnished with a steel reinforcing strike, two 3” security jamb screws and is covered with an armored front to conceal the fasteners and guard against theft. </li> \r\n<li>Latches are supplied standard with a full lip strike.</li>\r\n<li>Solid brass deadbolt has 1” throw when extended and a hardened steel insert for maximum protection and security. </li> \r\n<li>Solid brass latch bolt has a 1/2” throw when extended to fully engage the door jamb.</li>\r\n<li>Cylinder: Cylinder supplied with 5-pin keying.</li>\r\n<li>Keys are designed with a 1-1/4” wide bow surface.</li>\r\n<li>Fully Reversible to accommodate most door conditions and facilitate installation</li>\r\n<li>Lockset accommodates any latch to deadbolt center to center measurement greater than 4-3/8”</li>\r\n<li>Designed to fit 2-1/8” face bore with no additional hardware.</li>\r\n<li><b>Lifetime Limited Warranty</b> on workmanship, materials, operation and PVD (003) polished brass finish.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Contemporary Tubular Minneapolis Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Interior Trim: 5162 Lever</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Deadbolt Length: 2-5/8\" square</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Top Plate Height: 3-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Top Plate Width: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Bottom Plate Height: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Bottom Plate Width: 1-29/32\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Overall Projection: 2-23/32\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Deadbolt Rosette Length: 2-5/8\" square</li>\r\n<li>Interior Lever Rosette Length: 2-21/32\" square</li>\r\n<li>Interior Lever Length: 4-15/32\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/4\" or 2-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Deadbolt to Latch Spacing: 5-1/4\" center to center</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/BAL-85390-specifications.pdf?v=1691094973\" target=\"new\"><b>Baldwin 85390 Minneapolis Sectional Handleset Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Minneapolis Sectional Handleset",
                "description": "The Minneapolis Sectional Handleset was made to grace the big city; but even if you don't live in the urban jungle, this modern handleset is perfect to bring the glamour of Minneapolis to any home. It is available as a single cylinder handleset which means that it has a keyed lock on the outside and a thumb turn on the inside.  It features an easy installation, it has an adjustable backset for 2-3/4 inches or 2-3/8 inches for a door thickness of 1-3/4 inches.\r\n",
